# The pathology data roots must stay out of git: their split `text` files are
# transcribed clinical reports, and wav.scp / lists/*.list / the ASR hyp blocks
# carry absolute paths into the private dataset.
#
# That is the only gap -- the repo-level .gitignore already covers data/, tensorboard/,
# *.pt and the parquet files (named *.tar but Apache Parquet). With this one line,
# `git add examples/switchlingua-yue/` takes exactly the 18 code/doc files. Nothing
# needed to re-read the conclusions lives in git either way: RESULTS.md holds the numbers
# and exp/*/epoch_*.yaml hold the per-epoch CV metrics.
data_mix*/
